---
import PlainPage from '../layouts/PlainPage.astro';
---

<PlainPage
	title="Privacy Policy"
	heading="Privacy policy"
	eyebrow="Legal"
	description="What SWG Devo collects when you read this site, why, and how to ask us to delete it."
	path="/privacy/"
	updated="1 Oct 2026"
>
	<h2>What we collect</h2>
	<p>
		Reading this site does not need an account. We do not set advertising cookies. Your light or dark theme choice is saved in your own browser only.
	</p>
	<h2>Email sign-up</h2>
	<p>If you sign up for email updates, we store your email address to send you new guides. Every email has an unsubscribe link.</p>
	<h2>Embedded videos</h2>
	<p>
		YouTube videos load only when you press play, using YouTube's privacy-enhanced mode. After that, YouTube's own privacy policy applies.
	</p>
	<h2>Your choices</h2>
	<p>To see or delete data we hold about you, contact us through the <a href="/contact/">contact page</a>.</p>
</PlainPage>
